<p>I *really* can't help but sense a connection to &quot;The Tape&quot; from the Ring, especially the Japanese novelization and sequels where indeed it became self-propagating and infecting other media/people as time went on before spoilers happen; it's just too perfect, the only thing that's missing is that it starts giving you emotional problems, rather than opens a gateway for a semi-dead Japanese girl to come kill you in a week, potentially raping you first. (It's Japanese horror, of <em>course</em> rape was going to be involved at some point.)</p>
